        "Instructions",
        "Choose up to three classes in B2–B4 (use (none) to leave a slot empty). Open the matching class BiS sheet and '… weapons top' sheet for that class. Stat planner scores are precomputed for the planner trio shown here at build time (default Paladin, Monk, Wizard). ONLY ONE worn haste item counts in a loadout — highest Haste% wins; do not stack multiple haste pieces. Source: eqlegendstools.com",
